#: plots.R:577
msgid "do the points follow the diagonal?"
msgstr "les points suivent-ils la diagonale ?"

#: plots.R:578
msgid ""
"The band is pointwise: about 5 % of points fall outside it even when the "
"model is right."
msgstr ""
"Environ 5 % des points sortent de la bande même quand le modèle est juste "
"(distrib. gaussienne/normale)."

#: plots.R:608
msgid "Model SE"
msgstr "ET du modèle"

#: plots.R:608
msgid "Robust SE"
msgstr "ET robuste"

#: plots.R:611
msgid "do the two standard errors agree?"
msgstr "les deux erreurs-types concordent-elles ?"

#: plots.R:612
msgid ""
"One point per coefficient: off the line, the family's variance assumption "
